{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "8a7e2b14-6c4a-4f2b-9d11-helm00000001",
    "name": "helm",
    "description": "helm — connector'ların yaptığı TAM HTTP çağrıları + helm Edge Function'ları. Variables sekmesinden değerleri doldur, çalıştır, ham yanıtı gör. Connector kodu: supabase/functions/helm-ingest/connectors/.\n\nKullanım:\n1) Import → bu JSON.\n2) Collection 'Variables' sekmesi — anahtarları doldur.\n3) AdMob için önce '0 — Refresh access token' çalıştır (token otomatik kaydolur).\n4) İstediğin connector çağrısını çalıştır, ham yanıtı incele.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "prerequest",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "// Koleksiyon-genel pre-request — tarih değişkenlerini hesapla.",
          "const now = new Date();",
          "const start = new Date(now.getTime() - 90 * 86400000);",
          "const fmt = (d) => d.toISOString().slice(0, 10);",
          "const ymd = (d) => `{\\\"year\\\":${d.getUTCFullYear()},\\\"month\\\":${d.getUTCMonth()+1},\\\"day\\\":${d.getUTCDate()}}`;",
          "pm.collectionVariables.set('DATE_90_AGO', fmt(start));",
          "pm.collectionVariables.set('DATE_TODAY', fmt(now));",
          "pm.collectionVariables.set('EPOCH_90_AGO', String(Math.floor(start.getTime()/1000)));",
          "pm.collectionVariables.set('EPOCH_NOW', String(Math.floor(now.getTime()/1000)));",
          "pm.collectionVariables.set('YMD_START', ymd(start));",
          "pm.collectionVariables.set('YMD_END', ymd(now));"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "AdMob",
      "description": "helm connector: connectors/admob.ts. Önce 0 — refresh_token ile access_token al; sonra 1 — networkReport.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "0 — Refresh access token",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (json.access_token) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('ADMOB_ACCESS_TOKEN', json.access_token);",
                  "  console.log('ADMOB_ACCESS_TOKEN kaydedildi (', json.expires_in, 'sn geçerli)');",
                  "} else {",
                  "  console.log('Token alınamadı:', json);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/x-www-form-urlencoded" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "urlencoded",
              "urlencoded": [
                { "key": "client_id", "value": "{{ADMOB_CLIENT_ID}}" },
                { "key": "client_secret", "value": "{{ADMOB_CLIENT_SECRET}}" },
                { "key": "refresh_token", "value": "{{ADMOB_REFRESH_TOKEN}}" },
                { "key": "grant_type", "value": "refresh_token" }
              ]
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "https://oauth2.googleapis.com/token",
              "protocol": "https",
              "host": ["oauth2", "googleapis", "com"],
              "path": ["token"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "1 — Network report (son 90 gün)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{ADMOB_ACCESS_TOKEN}}" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"reportSpec\": {\n    \"dateRange\": {\n      \"startDate\": {{YMD_START}},\n      \"endDate\": {{YMD_END}}\n    },\n    \"dimensions\": [\"DATE\"],\n    \"metrics\": [\"ESTIMATED_EARNINGS\", \"IMPRESSIONS\", \"IMPRESSION_RPM\"]\n  }\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "https://admob.googleapis.com/v1/accounts/{{ADMOB_PUBLISHER_ID}}/networkReport:generate",
              "protocol": "https",
              "host": ["admob", "googleapis", "com"],
              "path": ["v1", "accounts", "{{ADMOB_PUBLISHER_ID}}", "networkReport:generate"]
            },
            "description": "Yanıt: header + row[] + footer akışı.\n- row.dimensionValues.DATE.value → 'YYYYMMDD'\n- row.metricValues.ESTIMATED_EARNINGS.microsValue → micros (raporlama para birimi cinsinden, /1e6)\n- row.metricValues.IMPRESSIONS.integerValue\n- row.metricValues.IMPRESSION_RPM.microsValue\n\nhelm currency: header.localizationSettings.currencyCode (TRY/USD/...)\nhelm: revenue=micros/1e6, impressions=integer, ecpm=RPM/1e6 (0 ise revenue/impressions*1000 fallback)"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "RevenueCat",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Overview metrics",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{REVENUECAT_SECRET_KEY}}" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "https://api.revenuecat.com/v2/projects/{{REVENUECAT_PROJECT_ID}}/metrics/overview",
              "protocol": "https",
              "host": ["api", "revenuecat", "com"],
              "path": ["v2", "projects", "{{REVENUECAT_PROJECT_ID}}", "metrics", "overview"]
            },
            "description": "Yanıt: { metrics: [{id, name, value, unit, ...}] }\nhelm aradığı id'ler: 'mrr', 'active_subscriptions', 'revenue'.\nGerçek id'ler RC'de farklı dönerse → 0 yazar. Yanıtı inceleyip id'leri DOĞRULA."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "PostHog",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "HogQL — günlük DAU (son 90 gün)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{POSTHOG_API_KEY}}" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"query\": {\n    \"kind\": \"HogQLQuery\",\n    \"query\": \"SELECT toDate(timestamp) AS day, uniq(person_id) AS dau FROM events WHERE timestamp >= now() - INTERVAL 90 DAY GROUP BY day ORDER BY day\"\n  }\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{POSTHOG_HOST}}/api/projects/{{POSTHOG_PROJECT_ID}}/query/",
              "host": ["{{POSTHOG_HOST}}"],
              "path": ["api", "projects", "{{POSTHOG_PROJECT_ID}}", "query", ""]
            },
            "description": "Yanıt: { results: [[date, dau], ...] }\nDAU 0 sürekli geliyorsa → person_id olayların çoğunda boş demektir."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "HogQL — anlık WAU (son 7 gün)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{POSTHOG_API_KEY}}" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"query\": {\n    \"kind\": \"HogQLQuery\",\n    \"query\": \"SELECT uniq(person_id) FROM events WHERE timestamp >= now() - INTERVAL 7 DAY\"\n  }\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{POSTHOG_HOST}}/api/projects/{{POSTHOG_PROJECT_ID}}/query/",
              "host": ["{{POSTHOG_HOST}}"],
              "path": ["api", "projects", "{{POSTHOG_PROJECT_ID}}", "query", ""]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
